# DS5007: one column in two roles.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| render timechart with (ycolumns = revenue, series = revenue)
---- expected
error[DS5007]: `revenue` is used for both the y-axis and `series`
  --> query:2:55
  |
2 | | render timechart with (ycolumns = revenue, series = revenue)
  |                                     -------           ^^^^^^^ used for `series` here
  |                                     |
  |                                     used for the y-axis here
  |
  = help: a column can fill only one role; remove it from one of them
